      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The outside-view base rate is the median of the 18 fetched monthly shares, 70.8688%. Their mean is 72.6488%; the latest six-month mean is 70.6280%. These support a level near 70%. August 2025 was 75.4975%, but one prior August does not establish a reliable seasonal adjustment."
      },
      {
        "kind": "tool",
