        "result": "The Idaho row reports 19476 beneficiaries due for renewal, 73% renewed, and 51% renewed on an ex parte basis. Those displayed percentages use all renewals due as denominator. The API counts yield 100*9870/19476=50.6778% on that basis and 100*9870/14129=69.8563% among beneficiaries renewed."
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "CMS Table 6 defines metric 5a as beneficiaries renewed and retained and metric 5a(1) as its ex parte subset. The historicalContext values are computed from those published counts and rounded to one decimal; interval calculations retain unrounded ratios."
