      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Required release-date verification could not be completed. The official publication page lists June 2026 released September 25, May released August 28, and April released July 31, but provides no prospective August 2026 publication date. The specifications' Table 10 associates December 15 with submission of updated pending-renewal outcomes, not CMS publication of original rows. The registered resolutionDate 2026-12-15 is preserved, but it remains unverified as an official release date; no date is inferred from cadence."
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Prior/update/interval: Use a persistence prior averaging the latest two O-row shares, 70.4076%, consistent with the full-history median base rate of 70.8688%. Additional level, momentum, seasonal, one-off, and policy adjustments are zero. Calibrate uncertainty on the July 2025-June 2026 reference class: 12 shares and 11 successive changes, retaining February and April. Their mean change is -0.377968 percentage points and sum of squared deviations is 3252.576860; sigma = 18.0349 percentage points = sqrt(3252.576860/10). The 80% half-width is 1.28*18.0349 = 23.0847 points. Bounds are 70.4076-23.0847 = 47.3229% and 70.4076+23.0847 = 93.4923%, rounded to 47.3%-93.5%. A mean-reverting level assumption avoids accumulating two months of random-walk variance."
